{"url": "https://www.bsu.edu/academics/collegesanddepartments/environmental-sciences/graduate-assistantships", "final_url": "https://www.bsu.edu/academics/collegesanddepartments/environmental-sciences/graduate-assistantships", "status": 200, "method": "http", "fetched": "2026-10-28", "text": "Graduate Assistantships - PhD in Environmental Sciences | Ball State University\nProspective Students\nCurrent Students\nFaculty / Staff\nAlumni\nParents\nDirectory\nContact Us\nApply\nMake a Gift\nToggle search\nToggle navigation\nEnvironmental Sciences Program\nProgram Overview\nApply\nGraduate Assistantships\nResearch Colloquium\nContact Us\nCollege of Sciences and Humanities\nBall State University\nHome\nProspective Students\nCurrent Students\nFaculty / Staff\nAlumni\nParents\nDirectory\nContact Us\nApply\nMake a Gift\nSearch Button\nEnvironmental Sciences Program\nOpen for More Navigation\nOpen for More Navigation\nEnvironmental Sciences\nProgram Overview\nGraduate Assistantships\nColloquium Series\nFaculty and Staff\nProgram Alumni\nContact Us\nGraduate Assistantships\nAcademics\nColleges and Departments\nEnvironmental Sciences\nGraduate Assistantships\nRequest Info\nContact Us\nApply Now\nOur graduate assistantships, awarded to top students based on academic performance, are an excellent way to help pay for your education while gaining supplemental experience and opportunities to interact with faculty.\nWe offer both teaching and research assistantships.\nCompensation and Benefits\nAs a graduate assistant, you\u2019ll receive:\na partial tuition remission (some fees still apply)\na stipend during the academic year\nResponsibilities and Expectations\nIn addition to assisting with research, you will help with:\nteaching\nclass management\ngrading\nstudy sessions\ncompiling information for lectures\nOther duties may also be assigned.\nWork for an Affiliated Department\nConsider applying for a position with one of our affiliated departments:\nBiology\nChemistry\nEnvironment, Geology, and Natural Resources\nGeography\nHow to Apply\nMost individual department awards for assistantships begin in the fall semester. For best consideration for assistantships, all application materials should be submitted by February 1 for the following academic year, and by January 1 if you are an international student.\nEnvironmental Sciences\nProgram Overview\nGraduate Assistantships\nColloquium Series\nFaculty and Staff\nProgram Alumni\nContact Us\nPhD in Environmental Sciences\nBall State University\nMuncie, Indiana 47306\nAcademic Year: 8 a.m.-5 p.m.\nSummer: 7:30 a.m.-4 p.m.\n(Eastern time)\n765-285-8060\nAcademics and Admissions\nAdmissions\nGraduate School\nInternational\nOnline Education\nFinancial Aid and Scholarships\nColleges and Departments\nHelpful Links\nMap and Directions\nCalendar of Events\nContact Us\nCollege Scorecard\nUniversity Libraries\nEmployment Opportunities\nOn-Campus Resources\nResources\nMyBallState\nBusiness Partners\nEmergency Preparedness\nAccessibility\nConsumer Disclosures\nMagazine\nNews Center\nUniversity Policies\nRelated Links\nVIEW SOCIAL MEDIA DIRECTORY\nBall State University 2000 W. University Ave. Muncie, IN 47306 800-382-8540 and 765-289-1241\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 Ball State University\nEqual Opportunity Policy\nLegal Information\nTTY Numbers\nSitemap\n\u00d7\nClose", "links": [["Prospective Students", "https://www.bsu.edu/admissions"], ["Current Students", "https://www.bsu.edu/gateways/current-students"], ["Faculty / Staff", "https://www.bsu.edu/gateways/faculty-and-staff"], ["Alumni", "https://www.bsu.edu/about/administrativeoffices/alumni"], ["Parents", "https://www.bsu.edu/gateways/parents"], ["Directory", "https://www.bsu.edu/directory"], ["Contact Us", "https://www.bsu.edu/about/contactus"], ["Apply", "https://www.bsu.edu/admissions/apply"], ["Make a Gift", "https://www.bsu.edu/foundation/give"], ["", "https://www.bsu.edu/"], ["Program Overview", "https://www.bsu.edu/academics/collegesanddepartments/environme